&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll own:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team leadership&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, coach, and scale a team of full-cycle mid-market &amp;amp; enterprise AEs and AMs from individual contributors to frontline managers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and evolve team structure as we scale from $20M to $50M to $100M ARR&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a high-performance culture with clear expectations and performance management frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll be a true player-coach - jumping on a call, running a demo, or working a deal alongside your team rather than managing from a dashboard&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Open to travel up to 20% of the time to meet with buyers and customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use UserGems and AI (Claude Cowork, Codex) to expand team’s capacity and effectiveness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Revenue and pipeline&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own team quota attainment and hold AEs accountable for outbound sourcing targets&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive forecasting accuracy, pipeline health, and revenue predictability&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage with key prospects and customers at the executive level to accelerate deals, negotiate, and strengthen relationships - on Zoom and in-person&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide feedback from the market (AEs, prospects, customers) to product, engineering, and&amp;nbsp; marketing teams to enhance our product and positioning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enablement &amp;amp; Process&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Initiate and own projects and process iterations that strengthen team performance to include enablement, new hire ramping, and compensation plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and evolve commission structure for the team- designing and maintaining plans that reward the right behaviors&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with marketing - both teams are measured by revenue, and this alignment is a core part of how we operate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;What you&#39;ve accomplished so far:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+&amp;nbsp; years in B2B SaaS sales with at least 5 years managing a team of full-cycle AEs&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of building, scaling, and leading high-performing teams that consistently exceed revenue targets&lt;/li&gt;
